{'symbol': 'WBA', 'date': '2019-10-22 22:30:00', 'title': 'WALGREENS BOOTS ALLIANCE DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 12, 2019', 'text': 'WALGREENS BOOTS ALLIANCE, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF 45.75 CENTS PER SHARE, UNCHANGED FROM THE PREVIOUS QUARTER AND AN INCREASE OF 4% FROM THE YEAR-AGO QUARTER. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE DECEMBER 12, 2019, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF NOVEMBER 18, 2019.'}